<section class="shell home-reading" aria-labelledby="home-reading-title"><div class="home-reading-top"><div><span class="reading-eyebrow">A PASSAGE TO BEGIN WITH</span><h2 id="home-reading-title">Find your next moment with the Quran.</h2></div><a href="/progress.html#saved-title" class="home-my-quran">My Quran <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><form class="home-search" action="/search.html" method="get" role="search"><label for="home-query">Search the Quran</label><div class="home-search-field"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 4 4"/></svg><input id="home-query" name="q" type="search" dir="auto" required maxlength="120" placeholder="An Arabic or English word, or a reference like 2:255"><button type="submit">Search <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div></form>__HOME_VOICE__<div class="home-shortcuts"><a href="/reader.html">Open Quran reader <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button type="button" id="home-popular-toggle" aria-controls="home-popular" aria-expanded="false">Popular passages <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><a href="/progress.html#saved-title"><span>Saved verses</span> <bdi id="home-saved-count" dir="ltr">0</bdi></a></div><div class="home-popular" id="home-popular" hidden><p>A curated set of reading shortcuts.</p><div class="home-popular-links"><a href="/reader.html?chapter=1"><span>Al-Fatihah</span><bdi dir="ltr">1</bdi></a><a href="/reader.html?verse=2:255"><span>Ayat al-Kursi</span><bdi dir="ltr">2:255</bdi></a><a href="/reader.html?chapter=18"><span>Al-Kahf</span><bdi dir="ltr">18</bdi></a><a href="/reader.html?chapter=36"><span>Ya-Sin</span><bdi dir="ltr">36</bdi></a><a href="/reader.html?chapter=55"><span>Ar-Rahman</span><bdi dir="ltr">55</bdi></a><a href="/reader.html?chapter=67"><span>Al-Mulk</span><bdi dir="ltr">67</bdi></a></div></div><div class="home-reading-grid"><article class="home-resume"><span class="reading-eyebrow">YOUR READING PLACE</span><h3 id="home-resume-title">Begin with a passage.</h3><p id="home-resume-description">Keep your place in the reader and return to it here.</p><a class="home-reading-primary" id="home-resume-link" href="/reader.html?chapter=1">Read Quran <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="home-reading-secondary" href="/progress.html">View reading progress</a></article><article class="home-goal" aria-labelledby="home-goal-title"><div class="home-goal-heading"><h3 id="home-goal-title">Daily reading goal</h3><a href="/progress.html#goal-form">Reading history</a></div><p class="home-goal-count"><bdi id="home-goal-count" dir="ltr">0 / 5</bdi><span>Verses marked today</span></p><progress id="home-goal-meter" value="0" max="5" aria-label="Daily reading goal progress"></progress><form id="home-goal-form"><label for="home-goal">Verses per day</label><div><input id="home-goal" name="goal" type="number" min="1" max="1000" step="1" value="5" required disabled><button type="submit" id="home-goal-save" disabled>Save goal</button></div></form><p id="home-goal-status" role="status" class="home-reading-note"></p><p class="home-reading-note">Only verses you mark as read count toward your goal.</p></article></div><a class="home-sync-link" href="/progress.html#reading-sync"><span id="home-data-status">Checking reading storage…</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><noscript><p>Open the reading progress page to manage your reading data.</p></noscript></section>
